### Entities

Familia = Genesis | PoW | PoST (enum).

Bloque struct with fields: id::Int, familia, padre::Int, altura::Int, trabajo::Int, pow_ok::Bool, slot::Int, productor::Int, sector::Int, peso::Int, requisito_declarado::Int, txs::Vector{Tx}.

Tx variants: Coinbase(salidas), CoinbasePost(importe), Transferencia(entradas, salidas, firmante), Deposito(entradas, clave, importe, firmante), Retiro(clave, importe, firmante), Liberacion(clave, importe, firmante), Evidencia(clave), AltaSector(id, clave, firmante), PruebaSector(id, firmante).

Salida: id, valor::UInt64, dueño::Int, origen enum, creada_en_altura::Int or creada_en_slot::Int (exactly one >= 0).

Wait "creada_en_altura::Int o creada_en_slot::Int (exactamente uno ≥ 0)". So one ≥0 and the other <0 (e.g., -1).

Garantia per key: activo::UInt64 (or Int128?), pendientes list of (importe, madura_en valor), en_retirada list (importe, inicio_slot), congelado=0, creditos_pendientes (D-T08).

Estado: UTXO (dict id->Salida, plus next output id?), garantías dict key->Garantia, emitido::UInt64, quemado::UInt64, fase, terminal, registro de sectores, more for undo.

### Parameters P

Parameters struct: H_dep, M_cb, M_dep, H_corte_min, W_min, S_min, K_min, q, M_res_slots, M_dep_slots, M_rec_slots, R_slots, F_slots, sec (SEC0/SECA), M_sec, P_sec, C_min, corte (HWΦ/H/W), seleccion (FC3/FC1/FC2), plus subsidio functions.

### Rules

TRN-01: Genesis emits 0. PoW at h≥1 may emit subsidio_pow(h).

TRN-02: coinbase_pow created at h can be spent in PoW at h' ≥ h+M_cb. If h+M_cb > altura(T), spendable in PoST from application slot ≥ s_0 + M_res_slots.

TRN-03: Deposit applied at h≥H_dep, consuming only outputs spendable at h, becomes pendiente and activo at h+M_dep if h+M_dep ≤ altura(T); else at application slot ≥ s_0 + M_dep_slots. A coinbase_pow inmadura cannot be deposited.

TRN-04: Terminal T is PoW block where altura(T) ≥ H_corte_min AND trabajo_acum(T) ≥ W_min AND Φ(Estado(T)) AND no PoW ancestor satisfies all three.

TRN-05: PoW block whose parent is terminal or descendant of a terminal is invalid.

TRN-06: PoST block invalid if its past doesn't contain exactly one terminal, or any of its parents is a PoW block other than that terminal. Transition block's only parent is T.

TRN-07: every PoST block requires garantia_activa(productor, past(B)) ≥ requisito(B) > 0. For transition block, past(B) = history up to T. Maturities evaluated at application point.

TRN-08: s_0 = 0, seed derivation placeholder.

TRN-09: selection FC-3.

TRN-10: withdrawal crossing the cut.

TRN-11: PoW reorg before cut.

TRN-12: late proof.

Order §3.9: order of application of a block: (a) validate shape and family; (b) promote pending with maturity ≤ h (or ≤ s), including D-T08 credits; (c) in PoST check producer guarantee (activo ≥ q) and in SEC-A that its sector is active; (d) apply txs in block order with coinbase first; (e) in PoW, evaluate if block is terminal.

Order §3.10: Coinbase by phase. PoW: Coinbase(salidas) UTXO outputs without attribution. PoST: CoinbasePost(importe) credits producer a pending credit with maturity M_rec_slots.

Order §3.11: Fees and emission. tarifas(B) = Σ(entradas − salidas) of its transfers. Deposits have no fee or change: Σ entradas == importe exactly, else ErrSaldo. Emitido := Σ_B (coinbase_pagada(B) − tarifas(B)). I-1 check: Σ UTXO + Σ garantías (activo + pendientes + en_retirada + congelado + créditos) == Emitido − Quemado. Also I-1b: Emitido ≤ Σ_B subsidio(B).

Wait, there's a subtlety: "Σ activo + Σ pendientes + ... + créditos". The "pendientes" in Garantía includes deposits pending and coinbase PoST credits pending? Let's think. D-T08 says the coinbase PoST credits a pending credit in Garantía[P]; when M_rec_slots passes it becomes activo. The Garantia struct has "creditos_pendientes (D-T08)". Hmm, and separately "pendientes" for deposits. In I-1 both count. Let me re-read:

Order §3.11: "I-1 es Σ UTXO + Σ garantías (activo + pendientes + en_retirada + congelado + créditos) == Emitido − Quemado".

Note §4.2 Garantia: `activo`, lista de `pendientes` (importe, madura_en_altura o madura_en_slot), lista de `en_retirada` (importe, inicio_slot), `congelado` (siempre 0 en v0), `creditos_pendientes` (D-T08).

