Actually wait — could we just merge them? They have different maturity semantics but both are pending amounts that become activo. The order distinguishes them in §4.2. I'll keep them separate.

Order §3.12: requisito_declarado ignored (X-10).

§3.13: ErrTerminalAmbiguo not reachable with one parent per block; declare and test in random histories that it never occurs.

§3.14: X-16 and I-3 evaluated with seleccionar and with nodo_en_linea at F_slots = typemax(Int). With finite F_slots, order dependence is C-FIN-01 expected behavior, recorded.

