cond_h = B.altura >= P.H_corte_min
cond_w = E.trabajo_acum >= P.W_min
cond_p = phi(E,P)
P.corte == CUT_HWPhi ? (cond_h && cond_w && cond_p) :
P.corte == CUT_H ? cond_h : cond_w
```

